{%- comment -%}
PFC Week — Week at a Glance from data/calendar-cache.json (written by the
daily sync job or /pfc-render-trello's calendar step; the builder has no
connector access). Filtering follows config/trello_calendar_filters.yaml,
the same rules as the Trello Week list. Every event of each day is shown. `stale` flags a cache
older than ~26 hours; show the fetch stamp so a stale wall is self-evident.

E-ink rules: no emoji, no inline styles — framework classes only.
{%- endcomment -%}
